# Runtime output & state
# state/ holds the World Model and H-MEM databases, the approval ledger, approved code,
# uploads/ (users' spreadsheets), outputs/ (filled workbooks), tasks/ and island-browser/ (the desktop
# island's browser profile). None of it belongs in git.
logs/*
!logs/.gitkeep
state/
uploads/
outputs/
island-browser/
*.log
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db
tmp/
temp/

# Local AI-assistant instructions, planning notes and personal tooling (kept on disk, not in the repo)
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
.claude/
docs/PROJECT_PLAN.md
docs/DEMO_SCRIPT.md
scripts/auto_push.ps1

# Built by scripts/build_deck.py from docs/deck/slides/ (the PDF is committed)
docs/deck/deck.html

